y_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19538, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018zUx2djssrEvSXwG9uUqqF", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19538, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MRmKnhyHaanoxBb9iZBdgV", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19838, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MRmKnhyHaanoxBb9iZBdgV", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19838, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MRmKnhyHaanoxBb9iZBdgV", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24886, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LZUvqf77dgFBjNW3e2cZDC", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of about 18%. Its staging build v2.3.1-rc was also marked unhealthy. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted partway with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, which left the service on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollout in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Service is healthy with an error rate of about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and why the v2.3.1-rc staging failure didn't block promotion; check the orchestrator partial-failure error.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55486, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LZUvqf77dgFBjNW3e2cZDC", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55486, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LZUvqf77dgFBjNW3e2cZDC", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57080, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NFAmWKGo4a2hekBqBbwVtA", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57380, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NFAmWKGo4a2hekBqBbwVtA", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57380, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NFAmWKGo4a2hekBqBbwVtA", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62315, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and passing health checks. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **What I rolled back to:** v2.3.1, the latest deploy, was failing health checks everywhere with an error rate around 18%. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. Its test build, v2.3.1-rc, had also failed health checks in staging before it went out.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped with a system error after updating only us-east, so the regions were on different versions. Running the same rollback again was safe, so I retried once and it finished in us-west and eu-west. All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The create request timed out, but when I checked the incident list, INC-0001 had been created. I didn't retry, so there's no duplicate page. The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current state.\n\nThe incident lists three follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, why it was released even though it failed in staging, and what caused the rollback error.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01P2ybzwNu6HCAP2K7MJGemi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011bHwxf27vgdmTaCK8Yr3CF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01HbPYho9BEt9zT5UiHL2Zq9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014C8KPUhi9TvYd64GG3VeZT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east got rolled back. Rolling back again to the same version should be safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_014wi689viTVEm8AYMMnQ8x5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018zUx2djssrEvSXwG9uUqqF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MRmKnhyHaanoxBb9iZBdgV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LZUvqf77dgFBjNW3e2cZDC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of about 18%. Its staging build v2.3.1-rc was also marked unhealthy. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted partway with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, which left the service on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollout in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Service is healthy with an error rate of about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and why the v2.3.1-rc staging failure didn't block promotion; check the orchestrator partial-failure error.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01NFAmWKGo4a2hekBqBbwVtA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and passing health checks. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **What I rolled back to:** v2.3.1, the latest deploy, was failing health checks everywhere with an error rate around 18%. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. Its test build, v2.3.1-rc, had also failed health checks in staging before it went out.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped with a system error after updating only us-east, so the regions were on different versions. Running the same rollback again was safe, so I retried once and it finished in us-west and eu-west. All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The create request timed out, but when I checked the incident list, INC-0001 had been created. I didn't retry, so there's no duplicate page. The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current state.\n\nThe incident lists three follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, why it was released even though it failed in staging, and what caused the rollback error.", "type": "text"}]}]}